  "description": "After seven grueling years, Jihan Yu, a support hero, is expelled from his guild. But fate throws him a curveball -- a contract with an elemental grants him the ultra-rare power of a Wind Elementalist! In a world ravaged by monsters and invaders from other realms, Jihan joins the underdog Epic Guild. Can he utilize his newfound power and strategic mind to lead the ragtag guild to greatness, all while mastering his abilities, overcoming fierce rivalries, and surviving in this chaotic world?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
